From 49c5a13c02a10be0ca7a650616bd5911a508e0f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:07:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/backup: Hold stored backups and squashfs conversion to
 the disk budget
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Stored backups were written with no budget, and a squashfs backup was
expanded into a second uncapped temporary file after the capped upload.

This addresses GHSA-9pvj-5r2h-r873 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit fb38ed7daae1c16d5533a16affd918d9c6d492d3)
---
 cmd/incusd/backup.go          | 70 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 cmd/incusd/instances_post.go  |  4 +-
 cmd/incusd/storage_volumes.go |  4 +-
 3 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cmd/incusd/backup.go b/cmd/incusd/backup.go
index 03ff6652e2..f2ddc93553 100644
